WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.019 --> 00:00:10.019
1.

00:00:10.019 --> 00:00:15.640
Coca-Cola is the second most universally understood
term in the world, just behind "okay".

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:19.640
94% of the world's population understand coca-cola.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.640
2.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:26.910
There are only 33 non-alcoholic drinks that
generate over 1 billion dolls in revenue.

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.239
Coca Cola own 15 of them.

00:00:29.239 --> 00:00:30.239
3.

00:00:30.239 --> 00:00:34.920
Coca-Cola spend more money on advertising
than Microsoft and Apple combined.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:39.570
In 2010 they spent a whopping $2.9 billion.

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:40.620
4.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:45.540
Coca-Cola manufacture so many different beverages
that if you drank one per day, it would take

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:50.780
you over 9 years to try all of them.

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:55.160
They have a scary, 3,500 beverages under their
name.

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:56.160
5.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:00.220
Despite what you may have been told coins
or teeth won't dissolve in coke when left

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:01.220
overnight.

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:02.220
This is a common misconception.

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:03.220
6.

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:07.759
At one time every glass of coke contained
about 9 milligrams of cocaine.

00:01:07.759 --> 00:01:09.580
However it was removed in 1903.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:10.580
7.

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.450
Years ago Coca-Cola launched an all out war
on water.

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:16.240
The campaign was called "Just say no to H2O".

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.400
In an attempt to get people to order coke
in restaurants instead of free tap water.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:23.950
The campaign was quickly stopped once people
started to spread the news around.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:24.950
8.

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:30.909
It takes 2 litres of water to make 1 litre
of Coca-Cola and over 290 billion litres of

00:01:30.909 --> 00:01:34.710
water are used to manufacture coke every year
around the world.

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:35.710
9.

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:41.159
The inventor of Coca-Cola who invented the
drink in 1886, was heavily addicted to morphine.

00:01:41.159 --> 00:01:52.029
He died two years after the brand was launched.

